      "body": "### Product\nAnimeGen\n\n### Website\nhttps://animegen.ai\n\n### What it does\nAnimeGen turns photos into anime art, avatars, and stylized illustrations with AI. Users upload one photo, choose a style, and create anime-style results online.\n\n### Pricing\nFree to start, with paid plans for higher usage.\n\n### Why it might be useful for indie hackers\nIt is a simple web-based creative tool for avatars, social images, and stylized illustrations, with a clear free entry point and commercial usage rights on paid plans.\n\n### Contact\nhi@animegen.ai",
